/* ============================================================================
   03-stamp-history.sql   —  run on _v2 AFTER 02-deploy-schema.ps1
   Marks every migration as applied so the app's startup MigrateAsync() is a no-op.
   Idempotent: only inserts MigrationIds not already present.
   ============================================================================ */
